@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084
@orderId = 2

### 1. Registrar la entrega del pedido 2 (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "courier": "Carlos Mena"
}

### 2. Listar entregas (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries

### 3. Consultar la entrega 1 (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/1

### 4. Segunda entrega para el mismo pedido (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "courier": "Otro repartidor"
}

### 5. Pedido que no existe (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 999,
  "courier": "Carlos Mena"
}

### 6. Datos inválidos (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courier": ""
}

### 7. Marcar la entrega 1 como entregada (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DELIVERED" }

### 8. Intentar marcarla otra vez (409)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DELIVERED" }
